Under the "DAKA DAKA!" shooting state: 
Continuously consume "Thermobaric Bullets" to attack the target, dealing <color=#e15226ff>Fusion DMG</color>;
When "Thermobaric Bullets" are exhausted, exit "DAKA DAKA!".

The Gravity Calibrator will emit different colored lights based on the direction of gravity. It will glow:
- <color=BlueD>Blue</color> when aligned with normal gravity;
- <color=YellowD>Yellow</color> when gravity is inverted;
- <color=GreenD>Green</color> when gravity is oriented sideways.

Upon casting Resonance Liberation <color=Highlight>Momentary Union</color>, Resonance Liberation <color=Highlight>Remnant Entities</color> gains the following enhancements:

-<color=Highlight>Remnant Entities</color> can be performed {0} more time(s);

-Healing multiplier of <color=Highlight>Remnant Entities</color> is increased by {1};

-<color=Highlight>Remnant Entities</color> deals additional <color=Ice>Glacio DMG</color> equal to {2} of Baizhi's Max HP.

Casting Resonance Liberation gives you: 
HP loss every second;
HP restored for every attack made;
ATK and DEF increase for every DMG taken (stacks up to 5 times). Lasts for 8s.

